y on double-stranded DNA-RNA hybrids (PubMed:36792600). May play a role in maintaining RNA integrity under stress conditions, for example in response to reactive oxygen species (ROS) (PubMed:36792600)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}